{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":2290,\"title\":\"Stargate Atlantis\",\"tagline\":\"A new gate will open. A lost city will rise again.\",\"overview\":\"With the Ancients' city of Atlantis discovered in the Pegasus Galaxy by Stargate Command, Dr. Elizabeth Weir and Major Sheppard lead a scientific expedition to the ancient abandoned city. Once there, the team not only find themselves unable to contact Earth, but their explorations unexpectedly reawaken the Ancients' deadly enemies, The Wraith, who hunger for this new prey. Now with the help of newfound local allies like Teyla Emmagan, the Atlantis Team sets about to uncover their new home's secrets even as their war of survival against the Wraith begins.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l0JYr2iqwId6VOmCV8dHzlIM6Wd.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/SLAPI1h9SWBMLTCO8ULvTGiP9G.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1273,\"year\":2004,\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Action & Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":5,\"totalEpisodes\":100,\"createdBy\":[\"Robert C. Cooper\",\"Brad Wright\"],\"networks\":[\"Syfy\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2009-01-08\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1214381,\"name\":\"Martin Wood\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/45imLzo7mXQY3ifrn7BVcRzw4XE.jpg\"},{\"id\":1222912,\"name\":\"Andy Mikita\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vn7CsRLXhPeInUS6PWiBJTt3FIs.jpg\"},{\"id\":141788,\"name\":\"William Waring\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":118463,\"name\":\"Peter DeLuise\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sLkSOm6HBLB4VCfshQLdSEq63tr.jpg\"},{\"id\":25882,\"name\":\"Brad Turner\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":44132,\"n