\"character\":\"Teyla Emmagan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zPutigjuf5ozJc1LtU3At9RbtGi.jpg\"},{\"id\":72092,\"name\":\"Jewel Staite\",\"character\":\"Jennifer Keller\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ztxDIZvuPreUixO6ZPxwkCg2UlO.jpg\"},{\"id\":16180,\"name\":\"Robert Picardo\",\"character\":\"Richard Woolsey\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9TOY0mhWRMlU5Ur8QHMoDecWs2n.jpg\"},{\"id\":117642,\"name\":\"Jason Momoa\",\"character\":\"Ronon Dex\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3troAR6QbSb6nUFMDu61YCCWLKa.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"eKs2PAiT_D8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"f15Qf0gKiSI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"bAwHzJpthEA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":32730,\"title\":\"The Event\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sdx0ibebbph6rNfB9cVqvjwlIWr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41411764705882353,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":2985,\"title\":\"Andromeda\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uAOyxeDiNwYU8GuOebU0FExh49C.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4078947368421053,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":63639,\"title\":\"The Expanse\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8djpxDeWpINnGhjpFXQjnBe6zbx.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.27677902621722844,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":64122,\"title\":\"The Shannara Chronicles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yzoaoBSMww5D22Kfrd2LEJumIzl.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2739837398373984,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Season 3\",\"seasonOverview\":\"The team faces escalating conflicts with both old and new adversaries, including the Wraith and a deadly new faction. The discovery of a potential game-changing technology introduces new ethical dilemmas, while relationships within the team are tested under growing pressures.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q6lRO3LgTnYqwliG4O3SPF7jSqK.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2006-07-13\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"No Man's Land (2)\",\"overview\":\"The team desperately attempts to stop two Wraith hive ships from reaching Earth. Sheppard must rely on an old foe to rescue McKay and Ronon.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uL9bbbIE795DtTbZBPZJygPYgZm.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"voteCount\":27,\"airDate\":\"2006-07-13\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Misbegotten (3)\",\"overview\":\"The Atlantis team must decide the fate of a colony of Wraith they have turned into humans. Dr. Weir must defend her leadership when she is evaluated by the I.O.A.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vVW7f2irqUzVXe3MAIH7lzlzBfA.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":27,\"airDate\":\"2006-07-20\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Irresistible\",\"overview\":\"Sheppard's team meets an obnoxious man who is adored by all thanks to a secret that he carries -- and who has an unexpected effect on them.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g1rubx5yFZU4zcKL5K4x36K0G2W.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"voteCount\":24,\"airDate\":\"2006-07-27\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Sateda\",\"overview\":\"Ronon Dex is captured by the Wraith and returned to his homeworld, where he is haunted by his past as he is forced to once again become their prey.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gDzGgBTFA3WiZjMwCqg1jevQzEw.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"voteCount\":24,\"airDate\":\"2006-08-03\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Progeny\",\"overview\":\"Weir and the team visit an advanced civilization that split off from the Lanteans thousands of years ago, but discover that they may not have left Atlantis in peace.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7MNywRdqD9mlKaSOR8bkZmpuKyA.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":24,\"airDate\":\"2006-08-10\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"The Real World\",\"overview\":\"Elizabeth Weir wakes up in a mental institution, where she is told that the expedition to Atlantis and the Stargate are figments of her imagination.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6wKLEYQzJoY7iCAonE5kaDmXB56.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":24,\"airDate\":\"2006-08-17\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Common Ground\",\"overview\":\"Colonel Sheppard finds himself the prisoner of a Genii commander, along with a desperately hungry Wraith who has been separated from his hive.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ogXoxpQt7HUlTDHRHDDIaKCOh6Y.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":23,\"airDate\":\"2006-08-24\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"McKay and Mrs. Miller\",\"overview\":\"Rodney McKay is reunited with his estranged sister back on Earth, who has given up a brilliant career as a scientist to raise a family.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mAe8ewwdaTwUEDEqnDpMi40Ityt.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"voteCount\":26,\"airDate\":\"2006-09-07\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Phantoms\",\"overview\":\"Sheppard and Ronon are influenced by a mind-altering device created by the Wraith while on a mission to rescue a lost team.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3Zsj06hyFdjJ7vQaysFDdpqbm3b.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":22,\"airDate\":\"2006-09-14\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"The Return (1)\",\"overview\":\"The Atlantis expedition is stunned to learn that a ship full of Ancients is returning to reclaim their lost city.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ms7915GM0u19ir3MEvds7D5jljP.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"voteCount\":24,\"airDate\":\"2006-09-21\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"The Return (2)\",\"overview\":\"The Atlantis team goes against orders to try and save Atlantis from Replicator control -- and to rescue General O'Neill and Richard Woolsey, who are trapped in the occupied city.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j3YDDguS4X4gilmtDnNR6070QNS.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"voteCount\":26,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-19\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Echoes\",\"overview\":\"The inhabitants of Atlantis begin to suffer ill effects when the planet's whale population begins migrating to the island city, bringing an unexpected harbinger of doom.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6IuekQcCjq0xU5EgjixbYiNAPQQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":24,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-26\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Irresponsible\",\"overview\":\"The team finds Lucius Lavin manipulating the people of another hapless planet, using Ancient technology to pose as an invincible hero.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zv9X73GxQWGwr9ICk09yWmW5RCi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"voteCount\":24,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-03\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Tao of Rodney\",\"overview\":\"After an Ancient device gives Rodney superhuman powers, his enhanced brilliance is checked only by his impending death -- unless he can learn how to ascend.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5zQM2mX0inIfNYusmaPziGPbsAK.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"voteCount\":24,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-10\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"The Game\",\"overview\":\"Sheppard and McKay discover that their competitive video game has been controlling a planet of real people, who now stand on the brink of war.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zbyvUkIEaya6ChSBypHM8lTCSLs.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"voteCount\":23,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-17\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"The Ark\",\"overview\":\"The team discovers the last of a civilization in suspended animation, whose survival is at risk when their station is critically damaged.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y30iAUUoUiSpxzUWLJMQ83Kc7v5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":23,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-07\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Sunday\",\"overview\":\"The team tries to relax during a mandatory day off, until an explosion leaves three people dead -- and reveals that one scientist is a walking time bomb.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kJJ0z5sERgFZEfpd1GHwtkCnkFx.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":27,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-11\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Submersion\",\"overview\":\"The team discovers an Ancient drilling station deep beneath the surface of the ocean, only to find that a Wraith queen is still alive there.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1exwYPurmmyNb8IkjJWFp5wEojR.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":24,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-14\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Vengeance\",\"overview\":\"The Atlantis team investigates the disappearance of one of their allies, only to find an old enemy engineering a race of powerful monsters.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q3xpASEzLDhSBDqP0SdD43uaMGw.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":23,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-28\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"First Strike (1)\",\"overview\":\"An unstoppable energy weapon leaves Atlantis under siege after Earth launches a preemptive attack against a very powerful enemy's homeworld.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gZmDS8pWkBbFF6DL2iFDXYIuB20.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":27,\"airDate\":\"2007-02-04\",\"runtime\":42}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2004-07-15\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}